{
 "_meta": {
  "bed": "local ERPNext dev bed, v15.94.3 (frappe 15.96.0), Standard chart of accounts, IDR",
  "recorded": "2026-11-16",
  "ticket": "#1599",
  "about": "ECX4-T0: Account create",
  "names": "synthetic: company \"ECX Probe Co\" (abbr EPC), parties and employees named \"ECX Probe ...\" / \"Probe ...\", bed users replaced by role labels",
  "apiUsers": {
   "apiUserWithSystemManager": "token-auth API user holding the 901-bot role set (Accounts Manager/User, Purchase Manager/User, Stock Manager/User, Sales Manager/User, Projects Manager/User, System Manager) plus HR Manager/User and, from the Supplier probe on, Purchase Master Manager",
   "apiUserWithoutSystemManager": "same roles minus System Manager (and without Purchase Master Manager)"
  },
  "notes": [
   "POST /api/resource/Account. Name becomes \"<account_name> - <company abbr>\"; a name that already ends with the suffix is suffixed again (\"Probe Suffix - EPC - EPC\"); an account_number is prefixed (\"5999 - Probe Numbered - EPC\").",
   "Required in practice: account_name, parent_account, company. Without company the ERP uses the API user default company (it silently picked ANOTHER company on the bed: always send company).",
   "root_type and account_type are optional: root_type is inherited from the parent (a mismatching root_type is IGNORED, 200 with the parent root type), account_type blank is accepted.",
   "account_type is checked against the doctype option list only (Nonsense -> 417 ValidationError listing the options); it is NOT checked against root_type (Bank under an Expense group -> 200).",
   "parent that is a leaf -> 417 ValidationError \"Parent account X can not be a ledger\". Parent of another company -> 417 ValidationError \"... does not belong to company\". Unknown parent -> 417 LinkValidationError. No parent -> 417 ValidationError \"The root account X must be a group\".",
   "Duplicate name (any parent, any letter case) -> 409 DuplicateEntryError, server message \"Account <name> already exists\". Missing account_name -> 500 AttributeError.",
   "Account create works for a user without System Manager (Accounts Manager).",
   "Lookup before create: GET /api/resource/Account with filters [company, account_name]; groups for a picker: filters [company, is_group=1, root_type]."
  ],
  "v16": "identical"
 },
